sequenceDiagram
  participant FS as 文件系统
  participant LD as loadSkillsDir
  participant CMD as Command 闭包
  participant IDX as 模型可见索引
  participant ST as SkillTool
  FS->>LD: 发现 SKILL.md
  LD->>FS: readFile 全文
  LD->>CMD: 保存 metadata + body
  CMD-->>IDX: 主要投影 name / description
  ST->>CMD: 调用 getPromptForCommand(args)
  CMD-->>ST: 展开后的完整正文
